<section id="admin-comments-content" data-live-region class="dm-wrap dm-section"><h1 class="admin-page-heading"><%= ui_icon(:comments) %>Comentários e denúncias</h1><p>Novos comentários são publicados automaticamente com filtro de linguagem. Use os controles abaixo para ocultar ou excluir conteúdo denunciado.</p><%= render "admin/shared/environment_filter" %>
<nav class="dm-actions"><% [["Todos", nil], ["Pendentes anteriores", "pending"], ["Publicados", "approved"], ["Rejeitados", "rejected"]].each do |label, status| %><%= link_to label, admin_comments_path(status: status, environment: params[:environment]), class: "dm-link" %><% end %></nav>
<% @comments.each do |comment| %><article class="dm-panel"><h2><%= comment.article.title %></h2><p><%= comment.display_name %> · <%= EditorialEnvironment::ENVIRONMENTS[comment.article.environment] %> · <%= (comment.approved? ? "Publicado" : editorial_status_label(comment.status)) %> · Denúncias: <%= comment.reports_count %></p><%= simple_format(h(comment.display_body), {}, sanitize: false) %><div class="dm-actions"><% [["Exibir", "approved"], ["Ocultar", "rejected"]].each do |label, status| %><%= button_to label, admin_comment_path(comment), method: :patch, params: {comment: {status: status}}, class: "dm-button" %><% end %><%= button_to "Excluir", admin_comment_path(comment), method: :delete, class: "dm-button", data: {turbo_confirm: "Excluir este comentário?"} %></div></article><% end %>
<% if @comments.empty? %><p>Nenhum comentário neste filtro.</p><% end %>
<div class="dm-actions"><%= link_to "← Anterior", request.query_parameters.merge(page: @page - 1), class: "dm-link" if @page > 1 %><%= link_to "Próxima →", request.query_parameters.merge(page: @page + 1), class: "dm-link" if @comments.size == 30 %></div></section>
